@base = http://localhost:8000/api/v1
@token = paste-parent-access-token
@student = 1
@main = 1
@savings = 2
@card = 1

### Itemized history (filters: wallet, entry_type, direction, from, to)
GET {{base}}/students/{{student}}/transactions/?wallet=main&page_size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Only purchases in a date range
GET {{base}}/students/{{student}}/transactions/?entry_type=pos_purchase&from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Spending summary for the child
GET {{base}}/analytics/students/{{student}}/spending/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
